{"step_index":200,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-08-26T04:45:31Z","thinking":"**Leveraging Previous Artifacts**\n\nI'm now focusing on utilizing existing artifacts, such as the `bg_home_1787718137754.jpg` file. My approach is to integrate these pre-generated elements directly, rather than recreating them. This aims for efficiency and reuse of what's already available. The objective is to refine the workflow to streamline tasks that can be managed this way.\n\n\n**Integrating Existing Assets**\n\nI'm now focused on directly integrating generated assets, specifically the backgrounds, into `index.html` and `style.css` for the Level 1 Golden Sample. I've listed the available background images and am preparing to implement them without any recreation.\n\n\n**Cataloging Available Assets**\n\nI've been cataloging all the available assets for Level 1 now, to get a clear picture of what's ready for integration. I've categorized the background images, characters (including the Mom avatar and bin character base), and several objects like shirts and jeans. I'm focusing on organizing this list to streamline the upcoming integration process.\n\n\n**Incorporating More Assets**\n\nI'm now integrating several new assets, including clothing items like pants and shoes, and props like suitcases and teddy bears. My immediate goal is to insert these directly into `index.html`, `style.css`, and `app.js`. I'll use forward-slash URLs for file references.\n\n\n**Visualizing HTML Structure**\n\nI'm now creating the Level 1 `index.html` structure. I'm focusing on directly integrating the assets within the HTML, referencing file paths. For the background, I'll use `#screen-1` with a `background-image` style. The \"Parent Prompt Icon\" will use an `img` tag. The wardrobe now includes 6 clothing items, each with `img` tags and image sources. I'm including bé Bin with a dedicated large image as well.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"CodeContent":"<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"vi\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0, maximum-scale=3.0, user-scalable=yes, viewport-fit=cover\">\n    <title>Cùng Bé Bin Đi Máy Bay (Parent-Co-Play Interactive Book)</title>\n    <!-- Offline font fallback stack & Google Font -->\n    <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n    <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.gstatic.com\" crossorigin>\n    <link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Nunito:wght@700;800;900&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n    <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"css/style.css\">\n</head>\n<body>\n    <div id=\"app-root\">\n        <!-- Canvas Pháo hoa, Sao lấp lánh & Trái tim -->\n        <canvas id=\"effects-canvas\"></canvas>\n\n        <!-- TOP BAR: 8 LEVEL DOTS & CỔNG BA MẸ -->\n        <header class=\"top-nav\">\n            <nav class=\"stage-indicators\" aria-label=\"Tiến trình chuyến bay\">\n                <button class=\"stage-dot active\" data-screen=\"1\" aria-label=\"Level 1: Mặc đồ\">👕</button>\n                <button class=\"stage-dot locked\" data-screen=\"2\" aria-label=\"Level 2: Xếp vali\">🧳</button>\n                <button class=\"stage-dot locked\" data-screen=\"3\" aria-label=\"Level 3: Kiểm tra an ninh\">🎫</button>\n                <button class=\"stage-dot locked\" data-screen=\"4\" aria-label=\"Level 4: Tìm Cổng Bay\">🚪</button>\n                <button class=\"stage-dot locked\" data-screen=\"5\" aria-label=\"Level 5: Hiệp sĩ đai\">🦸</button>\n                <button class=\"stage-dot locked\" data-screen=\"6\" aria-label=\"Level 6: Ngắm mây\">☁️</button>\n                <button class=\"stage-dot locked\" data-screen=\"7\" aria-label=\"Level 7: Lịch sự\">🤫</button>\n                <button class=\"stage-dot locked\" data-screen=\"8\" aria-label=\"Level 8: Nhận vali & Thưởng\">🏆</button>\n            </nav>\n\n            <!-- Cổng Ba Mẹ (Giữ 3 giây) -->\n            <button id=\"btn-parent-gate\" class=\"tycoon-btn parent-gate-btn\" aria-label=\"Cổng Ba Mẹ (Giữ 3 giây)\">\n                <svg class=\"parent-hold-ring\" viewBox=\"0 0 60 60\">\n                    <circle id=\"parent-ring-circle\" cx=\"30\" cy=\"30\" r=\"26\"></circle>\n                </svg>\n                ⚙️ <span>Ba Mẹ</span>\n            </button>\n        </header>\n\n        <!-- BIỂN BÁO LỜI THOẠI BA MẸ ĐỌC CHO BÉ (PARENT PROMPT BANNER VỚI AVATAR MẸ THẬT) -->\n        <div class=\"parent-prompt-container\">\n            <div class=\"parent-prompt-signboard\">\n                <img id=\"parent-prompt-icon\" class=\"prompt-avatar-art\" src=\"file:///C:/Users/USER/.gemini/antigravity/brain/6f49409f-fe23-4490-984d-4f0e771339c6/mom_avatar_1787719044616.jpg\" alt=\"Mẹ\">\n                <span id=\"parent-prompt-text\" class=\"prompt-speech-text\">“Bin sắp đi máy bay rồi. Con chọn bộ đồ nào giúp Bin dễ vận động nhé!”</span>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- VIEWPORT 8 MÀN CHƠI CHÍNH -->\n        <main class=\"screens-viewport\">\n\n            <!-- ==========================================================================\n                 LEVEL 1: TRANG PHỤC THOẢI MÁI (GOLDEN SAMPLE VISUAL 100% ARTWORK)\n                 ========================================================================== -->\n            <section id=\"screen-1\" class=\"screen active\">\n                <div class=\"wardrobe-arena\">\n                    <!-- Tủ quần áo chứa 6 món đồ Artwork 3D -->\n                    <div class=\"wardrobe-cabinet-art\">\n                        <!-- 1. Áo thun mềm (Soft) -->\n                        <button class=\"clothes-tile-art\" data-clothing-item=\"true\" data-fit=\"soft\" data-type=\"shirt\" aria-label=\"Áo thun mềm\">\n                            <img src=\"file:///C:/Users/USER/.gemini/antigravity/brain/6f49409f-fe23-4490-984d-4f0e771339c6/shirt_soft_1787719072757.jpg\" class=\"item-img-art\" alt=\"Áo thun mềm\">\n                            <span class=\"item-label-tag\">Áo thun êm</span>\n                        </button>\n                        \n                        <!-- 2. Quần bò cứng (Stiff) -->\n                        <button class=\"clothes-tile-art\" data-clothing-item=\"true\" data-fit=\"stiff\" data-type=\"jeans\" aria-label=\"Quần bò cứng\">\n                            <img src=\"file:///C:/Users/USER/.gemini/antigravity/brain/6f49409f-fe23-4490-984d-4f0e771339c6/jeans_stiff_1787719123153.jpg\" class=\"item-img-art\" alt=\"Quần bò cứng\">\n                            <span class=\"item-label-tag\">Quần bò cứng</span>\n                        </button>\n\n                        <!-- 3. Quần thun co giãn (Soft) -->\n                        <button class=\"clothes-tile-art\" data-clothing-item=\"true\" data-fit=\"soft\" data-type=\"pants\" aria-label=\"Quần thun co giãn\">\n                            <img src=\"file:///C:/Users/USER/.gemini/antigravity/brain/6f49409f-fe23-4490-984d-4f0e771339c6/pants_soft_1787719157043.jpg\" class=\"item-img-art\" alt=\"Quần thun co giãn\">\n                            <span class=\"item-label-tag\">Quần thun êm</span>\n                        </button>\n\n                        <!-- 4. Bộ liền rườm rà (Stiff) -->\n                        <button class=\"clothes-tile-art\" data-clothing-item=\"true\" data-fit=\"stiff\" data-type=\"dress\" aria-label=\"Bộ liền rườm rà\">\n                            <img src=\"file:///C:/Users/USER/.gemini/antigravity/brain/6f49409f-fe23-4490-984d-4f0e771339c6/outfit_onepiece_1787719198691.jpg\" class=\"item-img-art\" alt=\"Bộ liền rườm rà\">\n                            <span class=\"item-label-tag\">Bộ yếm rườm rà</span>\n                        </button>\n\n                        <!-- 5. Giày dán xé (Soft) -->\n                        <button class=\"clothes-tile-art\" data-clothing-item=\"true\" data-fit=\"soft\" data-type=\"shoes\" aria-label=\"Giày dán xé\">\n                            <img src=\"file:///C:/Users/USER/.gemini/antigravity/brain/6f49409f-fe23-4490-984d-4f0e771339c6/shoes_velcro_1787719241323.jpg\" class=\"item-img-art\" alt=\"Giày dán xé\">\n                            <span class=\"item-label-tag\">Giày dán tiện</span>\n                        </button>\n\n                        <!-- 6. Giày nhiều dây (Stiff) -->\n                        <button class=\"clothes-tile-art\" data-clothing-item=\"true\" data-fit=\"stiff\" data-type=\"boots\" aria-label=\"Giày nhiều dây\">\n                            <img src=\"file:///C:/Users/USER/.gemini/antigravity/brain/6f49409f-fe23-4490-984d-4f0e771339c6/boots_laces_1787719296706.jpg\" class=\"item-img-art\" alt=\"Giày nhiều dây\">\n                            <span class=\"item-label-tag\">Giày nhiều dây</span>\n                        </button>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <!-- Nhân vật Bé Bin 3D Full-Body Focal Point -->\n                    <div class=\"bin-character-stage\">\n                        <div id=\"bin-dress-target\" class=\"bin-stage-pedestal\">\n                            <img id=\"bin-main-art\" class=\"bin-fullbody-img\" src=\"file:///C:/Users/USER/.gemini/antigravity/brain/6f49409f-fe23-4490-984d-4f0e771339c6/bin_character_1787718423417.jpg\" alt=\"Bé Bin 3 Tuổi\">\n                            \n                            <!-- Các huy hiệu trang phục đã chọn thành công -->\n                            <div class=\"dressed-badges-overlay\">\n                                <div id=\"bin-slot-shirt\" class=\"dress-check-badge\">Áo ⏳</div>\n                                <div id=\"bin-slot-pants\" class=\"dress-check-badge\">Quần ⏳</div>\n                                <div id=\"bin-slot-shoes\" class=\"dress-check-badge\">Giày ⏳</div>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <button id=\"btn-next-level-1\" class=\"tycoon-btn tycoon-btn-green hidden\" style=\"margin-top: 10px; font-size: 20px; padding: 12px 28px; z-index: 50;\">\n                    Đi Xếp Vali Nào! 🧳 ➡️\n                </button>\n            </section>\n\n            <!-- ==========================================================================\n                 LEVEL 2: CHIẾC VALI KỲ DIỆU\n                 ========================================================================== -->\n            <section id=\"screen-2\" class=\"screen\">\n                <div class=\"suitcase-arena\">\n                    <div style=\"display: